                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1f3f72f0-bc78-3834-b4f7-93d3e004d5fc",
                        "entry_id": "723affe8-3a22-340c-bcd5-9fa1822bc5cd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An emphatic form of oh my God."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c034261b-52b8-4c73-93fe-4b62e2b3d41a",
                                "sense_id": "1f3f72f0-bc78-3834-b4f7-93d3e004d5fc",
                                "text": "I wouldn't be exaggerating if I said that my initial reaction to this machine went something like: ZOMG it's an overgrown Blackberry.^([sic])"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ebacc17d-f5f9-42c7-ae4d-8afaa02261d3",
                                "sense_id": "1f3f72f0-bc78-3834-b4f7-93d3e004d5fc",
                                "text": "My fellow Tweeters were supportive, bless their hearts, but I know I was getting annoying constantly tweeting stuff like: \"ZOMG I JUST BURNED 1K CALORIES!!11!\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "115ae8c3-bddb-450c-9587-090692e34c78",
                                "sense_id": "1f3f72f0-bc78-3834-b4f7-93d3e004d5fc",
                                "text": "What was he doing pursuing me? He didn't seem happy about it, like, ZOMG, I met my soul mate and now my life can begin! It was more like he was being compelled against his will."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
